OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F169A1790576654
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AOur Friends in the North still relevant
OL,4,A- writer
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in an interview ahead of a new
OL,7,Fstage adaptation in Newcastle, he said
OL,8,Fhe was expecting the 21st Century
OL,9,Faudience to recognise the same problems
OL,10,Ftoday.
OL,12,F"If you asked me 30 years ago, would
OL,13,Fthings be as bad as they are now, I'd
OL,14,Fprobably have said no. I'd have said
OL,15,Fthings are sure to get better and we
OL,16,Fwould do something about inequality,
OL,17,Fcorruption, greed, deprivation in
OL,18,Fpockets of the UK."
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
